{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948470/extras/9933593c40245402e1b48ec3b1c3fb58.avif?t=1767649077\" width=780 height=155 /></span>Lead humanity\u2019s fight to outmaneuver Algorithm Alpha.\u00a0 Fusing 4X strategy and turn-based tactical warfare, every choice will determine humanity's fate in a war of the Meaties vs the Machines. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humanity is at its lowest. Overrun and overruled by an AI algorithm that has seized control of Earth, you are tasked with fortifying a stronghold, recapturing contested resources, and striking back against an enemy that holds the advantage from the Day 1.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Victory will be an uphill battle; reliant on your ability to prioritize and exploit every opportunity.\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal is simple: reclaim control or be erased.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948470/extras/badb50b59b8b509732c8b67fc6dbbe37.poster.avif?t=1767649077\" width=780 height=437 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948470/extras/badb50b59b8b509732c8b67fc6dbbe37.webm?t=1767649077\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A relentless wave of attacks is on the horizon and the enemy grows stronger with every passing day. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To survive, you\u2019ll need more than walls\u2014you\u2019ll need to adapt on the fly.\u00a0 Reassessing your tactics and expanding your command posts as the fight progresses is a must.\u00a0 Recapturing and denying enemy resources is crucial to gaining the upper hand.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemy reinforcements arrive in waves at regular intervals. Only by keeping pace with the escalating onslaught can you hope to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948470/extras/fec76b1b45e620b1cf0dca42ecb98e6b.poster.avif?t=1767649077\" width=780 height=437 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948470/extras/fec76b1b45e620b1cf0dca42ecb98e6b.webm?t=1767649077\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resources are scarce, and every piece of scrap is contested. Reclaim vital resources to expand your reach and fuel your war machine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An action point system lets you convert energy into additional actions, extending your reach and enabling powerful abilities when you need them most.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the war escalates, an evolving tech tree unlocks powerful defenses and devastating countermeasures, giving you the edge in a brutal war of attrition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strike back by targeting enemy outposts; shutting down reinforcements before they overwhelm you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948470/extras/3ae1052f91741cda9985bd993c3bea9d.poster.avif?t=1767649077\" width=780 height=433 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948470/extras/3ae1052f91741cda9985bd993c3bea9d.webm?t=1767649077\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only when all of the enemies outposts have been destroyed can we consider ourselves  safe from systematic annihilation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948470/extras/a84e179d2f989eb3db96c79dec0c0ef9.avif?t=1767649077\" width=780 height=153 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Timed Rounds</strong> \u2014 Keep the pressure on by enabling an optional 15 or 30 second turn timer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Action Point Economy</strong> \u2014 Allocate action points at the expense of resources  to maximize your tactical options each turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expansive Technology Tree \u2014</strong>\u00a0Unlock new unit abilities, tactical tools, and economic upgrades as you progress through multiple tiers of research.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom Map Editor</strong> \u2014 Create your own battlefields and unique missions with an in-game map editor. Share your creations with the community and test different strategies on other player made creations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PvP/Multiplayer</strong> \u2014 Challenge friends in tactical 1v1 combat. Play  custom maps, change turn length, and assert your dominance in head-to-head gameplay.\u00a0 Play using in-game procedural generated battlefields or custom player-made\u00a0 ones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedural Map Generation</strong> \u2014 Each play unfolds on a unique battlefield, keeping games fresh and unpredictable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evolving Terrain</strong> \u2014 Battlefields respond to combat and become damaged over time. Damaged areas become harder to traverse and modify offensive and defense bonuses, forcing players to adapt there strategy at every turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat Unit Experience</strong> \u2014 Meaty units grow stronger over time, earning experience on the battlefield. Deploying and maneuvering squads carefully allows players to create groups of elite fighters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replayability</strong> \u2014 An expanding technology tree, diverse units, varied terrain, and multiple resources\u2014powered by procedural map generation\u2014ensure no two runs play the same.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Blood Traitor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2948470/e3c6e20b3b2c7b48cd8bba01b72deca33474c3e3.jpg"},{"name":"Billy Badass","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2948470/2097a48e4366a2d0de840886603425a4295214ff.jpg"},{"name":"Mr. Moneybags","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2948470/ab494f3b9e47d115f62e7a7bb4ac8d6e828e045f.jpg"},{"name":"Action Economy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2948470/6d25052e0a018ce9f3302dba77bbc74c1e62f43e.jpg"},{"name":"Meaty Supreme","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2948470/8067e8716ec04fbec8aa5bc988ed4d42405d7708.jpg"},{"name":"Machine Supreme","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2948470/12d0177dfeac76aa44c921166084809d10a0a7aa.jpg"},{"name":"Have A Nap... Then Fire Ze Missiles!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2948470/121205efffbc8efc9684d73f609095862d281439.jpg"},{"name":"All The Science!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2948470/4447373ac491af5bb2e1fcaf524260760a80ca32.jpg"},{"name":"Underpowered","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2948470/6a5fa28643770829a9bafbcbe303e0e7783bdad7.jpg"},{"name":"Shatter Their Sky!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2948470/163fc8baeb9892ff0a3229832937cdda669f2275.jpg"}],"total":35},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2948470?t=1767649077","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2948470?t=1767649077","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948470/a8324e53a66dadc77e894a5c256c1c4adfb59177/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767649077","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948470/a8324e53a66dadc77e894a5c256c1c4adfb59177/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767649077","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3495190,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948470/extras/9933593c40245402e1b48ec3b1c3fb58.avif?t=1767649077\" width=780 height=155 /></span>Lead humanity\u2019s fight to outmaneuver Algorithm Alpha.\u00a0 Fusing 4X strategy and turn-based tactical warfare, every choice will determine humanity's fate in a war of the Meaties vs the Machines. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humanity is at its lowest. Overrun and overruled by an AI algorithm that has seized control of Earth, you are tasked with fortifying a stronghold, recapturing contested resources, and striking back against an enemy that holds the advantage from the Day 1.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Victory will be an uphill battle; reliant on your ability to prioritize and exploit every opportunity.\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal is simple: reclaim control or be erased.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb