aragraph\" >As the war escalates, an evolving tech tree unlocks powerful defenses and devastating countermeasures, giving you the edge in a brutal war of attrition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strike back by targeting enemy outposts; shutting down reinforcements before they overwhelm you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948470/extras/3ae1052f91741cda9985bd993c3bea9d.poster.avif?t=1767649077\" width=780 height=433 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948470/extras/3ae1052f91741cda9985bd993c3bea9d.webm?t=1767649077\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only when all of the enemies outposts have been destroyed can we consider ourselves  safe from systematic annihilation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948470/extras/a84e179d2f989eb3db96c79dec0c0ef9.avif?t=1767649077\" width=780 height=153 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Timed Rounds</strong> \u2014 Keep the pressure on by enabling an optional 15 or 30 second turn timer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Action Point Economy</strong> \u2014 Allocate action points at the expense of resources  to maximize your tactical options each turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expansive Technology Tree \u2014</strong>\u00a0Unlock new unit abilities, tactical tools, and economic upgrades as you progress through multiple tiers of research.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom Map Editor</strong> \u2014 Create your own battlefields and unique missions with an in-game map editor. Share your creations with the community and test different strategies on other player made creations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PvP/Multiplayer</strong> \u2014 Challenge friends in tactical 1v1 combat. Play  custom maps, change turn length, and assert your dominance in head-to-head gameplay.\u00a0 Play using in-game procedural generated battlefields or custom player-made\u00a0 ones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedural Map Generation</strong> \u2014 Each play unfolds on a unique battlefield, keeping games fresh and unpredictable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evolving Terrain</strong> \u2014 Battlefields respond to combat and become damaged over time. Damaged areas become harder to traverse and modify offensive and defense bonuses, forcing players to adapt there strategy at every turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat Unit Experience</strong> \u2014 Meaty units grow stronger over time, earning experience on the battlefield. Deploying and maneuvering squads carefully allows players to create groups of elite fighters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replayability</strong> \u2014 An expanding technology tree, diverse units, varied terrain, and multiple resources\u2014powered by procedural map generation\u2014ensure no two runs play the same.</p>","developers":["Software Verde, LLC"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948470/de1ee2d8c8eee8b507d856f07b6e3f6f6c71d119/header.jpg?t=1767649077","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5, 3rd gen (or equivalent)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 6 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 660 or AMD Radeon HD 7870<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul cla